          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na zahabu yosi iriyolaviwa kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu dza sadaka ni akulu a vikosi vya anajeshi elufu-elufu na akulu a vikosi vya anajeshi gana-gana kala ina uziho wa kama kilo magana mairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
